b4-46a5-99ee-e3b90e68f277">1,503,726</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock. Each share of Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock and the related warrants were sold at a subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i573f535efd9346e88d167adefdea35ac_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNDIvZnJhZzphMmRiZjY5NTA0Zjg0N2QyOTlmN2M3NGEwMTAwNGRmYy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmEyZGJmNjk1MDRmODQ3ZDI5OWY3Yzc0YTAxMDA0ZGZjXzkyNQ_1266e642-c02e-446d-bdde-e8661f7b6433">940</ix:nonFraction>, representing an original issue discount of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i573f535efd9346e88d167adefdea35ac_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionOriginalIssuanceDiscount" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNDIvZnJhZzphMmRiZjY5NTA0Zjg0N2QyOTlmN2M3NGEwMTAwNGRmYy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmEyZGJmNjk1MDRmODQ3ZDI5OWY3Yzc0YTAxMDA0ZGZjXzk3Mg_e00cc14c-6dc5-425c-a2ca-7263441f6d9c">6</ix:nonFraction>% of the stated value of each share of Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock for an aggregate subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i573f535efd9346e88d167adefdea35ac_I20220322" decimals="-5" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionAggregateValue" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNDIvZnJhZzphMmRiZjY5NTA0Zjg0N2QyOTlmN2M3NGEwMTAwNGRmYy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmEyZGJmNjk1MDRmODQ3ZDI5OWY3Yzc0YTAxMDA0ZGZjXzEwODk_f9968bfc-b902-4dd5-9689-b910811df11d">50.0</ix:nonFraction> million. The net proceeds to the Company from this offering was  $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="if25b6e2131d54b5cac3e3fb1d576cf9f_D20220322-20220322" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromI