 provided by management of the Company. The goodwill represents the excess fair value after the allocation to the intangibles. The calculated goodwill is not tax deductible for tax purposes.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Total acquisition-related costs for the Acquisition incurred during the period ended December&#160;31, 2021 ended was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i21013ce7478f4237ba8b63e9000c85e5_D20210101-20211231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCosts" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTEvZnJhZzo4ZWY5MDBkNzM1ZTM0ODU3YmNhOGMxODVkMmFlMTI0YS90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjhlZjkwMGQ3MzVlMzQ4NTdiY2E4YzE4NWQyYWUxMjRhXzE5Nzc_64aa1835-3542-4b7d-a385-2ea928de2ad4">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million and is included in acquisition-related costs in the Purchaser&#8217;s Statements of Operations. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="inpx:ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsAcquisitionRelatedCostsByAcquisitionTableTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTEvZnJhZzo4ZWY5MDBkNzM1ZTM0ODU3YmNhOGMxODVkMmFlMTI0YS90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjhlZjkwMGQ3MzVlMzQ4NTdiY2E4YzE4NWQyYWUxMjRhXzIxNzA_9560a172-36ec-450f-9565-1e1ed8494d15" continuedAt="i4af552413d28437595e0cc033f1b0144" escape="true">The below table details the acquisition-related costs for the Acquisition (in thousands):</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><ix:continuation id="i4af552413d28437595e0cc033f1b0144" continuedAt="i2e22d0d429d64bc283444adc8ba362b5"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="wi