-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i8269c93456dd490babec737b4a934c51_I20210423" decimals="-3" name="inpx:AssetAcquisitionAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedNet" scale="3" id="_a988c4a3-1413-4bf6-aec6-ed61a9579cbe">490</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></div></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><div id="ibb5d0eb17e77468eb79dc6027d5535b1_157"></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 6 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="inpx:MergersAcquisitionsAndDispositionsDisclosuresAcquisition2TextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzYzNDY_85e4b6fb-5324-4c45-95e9-f9f24b441593" continuedAt="id47fc2ed91d84c5ba740b7d77aa1aa68" escape="true">CXApp Acquisition</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-34</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div></div><ix:continuation id="id47fc2ed91d84c5ba740b7d77aa1aa68" continuedAt="i1641eb3817464d11af3c92da0f859c13"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">On April 30, 2021, the Company acquired Design Reactor, Inc. (&#8220;CXApp&#8221;) which enables corporate enterprise organizations to provide a custom-branded, location-aware employee app focused on enhancing the workplace experience and hosting virtual and hybrid events. An important aspect of the Company&#8217;s strategy towards delivering a comprehensive indoor intelligence offering required direct engagement with the end-user through an app. With the CXApp acquisition, the Company was able to establish that direct engagement, eliminating the need for a third part app developer partner.  The transaction was attractive to the Company because it would complete its strategic vision to have the most comprehensive suite of indoor intelligence solutions, was anticipated to be accretive to earnings and revenue, increase the Company&#8217;s average selling price and result in the acquisition of several marquee customers. In exchange for the aggregate purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i73db78f4f2ae42479795baad33657626_D20210430-20210430" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzk5MA_553ab602-946d-40d1-90f6-a382f8f8e0c8">32.1</ix:nonFraction> million, the Company acquired all of the outstanding capital of the CXApp, incorporated in the State of California. The price was subject to certain post-closing adjustments based on actual working capital as of the closing as described in the stock purchase agreement. The goodwill of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i495f68191faa4b0989e9c3f75ea54546_I20210430" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzEyODA_624eb562-9f9a-42de-9764-8413eb4e6f68">15.3</ix:nonFraction> million arising from the acquisition consists of an acquired workforce, as well as synergies and economies of scale expected from combined operations of Inpixon and the CXApp. </span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><ix:continuation id="ia08428570142434b94db1aeeaa863d91" continuedAt="i5567cc5f1f0c48adbbad22b253319290"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">The following table represents the purchase price (in thousands). </span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:79.747%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:18.053%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;