:BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedOtherTaxLiabilities" scale="3" id="_67c19061-75ea-4afa-9f79-b29a043883d5">28</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 7pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Total liabilities assumed</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i495f68191faa4b0989e9c3f75ea54546_I20210430" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedLiabilities" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_0252d529-8cd5-4f83-a7d7-4cff3803fda1">4,257</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 13pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Estimated fair value of net assets acquired:</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i495f68191faa4b0989e9c3f75ea54546_I20210430" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredGoodwillAndLiabilitiesAssumedNet" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_9a3047ca-edd8-45ed-9c4a-303a9e8215f8">32,132</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></div></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">The value of the intangibles and goodwill were calculated by a third party valuation firm based on projections and financial data provided by management of the Company. The assets were valued using a combination of multi-period excess earnings methodologies, a relief from royalty approach, a discounted cash flow approach and present value of cash flows approach.  The goodwill represents the excess fair value after the allocation to the intangibles. The calculated goodwill is not tax deductible for tax purposes.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Total acquisition-related costs for the Acquisition incurred during the year ended December 31, 2021 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i73db78f4f2ae42479795baad33657626_D20210430-20210430" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCosts" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzQ4MTg_10f5a1aa-4aa5-4597-9dfc-d7ad40e38f91">0.5</ix:nonFraction> million and is included in acquisition-related costs in the Company&#8217;s Statements of Operations. <ix:continuation id="i2e22d0d429d64bc283444adc8ba362b5" continuedAt="i572e1a22009e4157a8c82db272b7495f">The below table details the acquisition-related costs for the Acquisition (in thousands):</ix:continuation></span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-36</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div></div><ix:continuation id="i3ec06f0452ef4ffb82486f647ca06e15"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><ix:continuation id="i572e1a22009e4157a8c82db272b7495f" continuedAt="i50db093a9268479aa3bf1784828e0f23"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:79.747%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:18.053%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Accounting fees</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="id7f6fdcfdb6247bdb20e4f75882e4a78_D20210101-20211231" decimals="-3" name="inpx:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCostsAccountingFees" scale="3" id="_f22fe1ee-f141-4a1f-93f2-377d5bdf9672">115</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Legal fees</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="id7f6fdcfdb6247bdb20e4f75882e4a78_D20210101-20211231" decimals="-3" name="inpx:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCostsLegalFees" scale="3" id="_4df0efdd-5112-408e-b673-ae15c8281b40">389</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 7pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Total acquisition costs</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="id7f6fdcfdb6247bdb20e4f75882e4a78_D20210101-20211231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCosts" scale="3" id="_4bf7a8f6-3525-4131-a57b-efecd95a2071">504</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">On March 3, 2022, we entered into a Second Amendment to that certain Stock Purchase Agreement, dated as of April 30, 2021 (the "CXApp Stock Purchase Agreement"), by and among the Company, Design Reactor, Inc. (the "CXApp") and the holders of the outstanding capital stock of CXApp (the "Sellers") with the Sellers' Representative (as defined in the CXApp Stock Purchase Agreement), pursuant to which the parties agreed that withholding taxes payable by certain of the Sellers, as applicable, in connection with the issuance of the Earnout Shares (as defined in the CXApp Purchase Agreement) would be offset up to the aggregate amount payable to such Seller by the Company from the Holdback Amount (as defined in the CXApp Purchase Agreement) and the Holdback Amount would be reduced by an equal amount.  On March 3, 2022, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ibe3cab40503f4f8bbd72cdc76f66ea5d_D20220303-20220303" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzU4NTA_bba69b5d-8374-4ddc-b64e-10e32e0ec3ac">144,986</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock to the Sellers in connection with the satisfaction of the Earnout Payment (as defined in the CXApp Purchase Agreement).  The fair market value of the Earnout Shares issued of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ibe3cab40503f4f8bbd72cdc76f66ea5d_D20220303-20220303" decimals="-5" name="inpx:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueEarnOut" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzYwNTE_8051cb99-da6b-48d7-bf46-60bbe9b5a0ee">3.7</ix:nonFraction> million was lower than the fair market value of the Earnout Shares as of December 31, 2021 of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i7ec26e8874c9452d9c90cc3e02a9925a_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueEarnOutLowerThanMarketValue" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzYxNDA_e0333e60-cf4d-4534-899e-2ec318fae2f6">6.5</ix:nonFraction> million, and therefore the Company recorded a benefit of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i7ec26e8874c9452d9c90cc3e02a9925a_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" sign="-" name="inpx:BusinessCombinationPostCombinationExpenseBenefit" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNTcvZnJhZzozNDljNTRjNWE5YTg0ODFlOTMwNWMzMzNhZTVlOWZkMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM0OWM1NGM1YTlhODQ4MWU5MzA1YzMzM2FlNWU5ZmQzXzYxOTI_0fd0f893-b6e3-41e4-8eaa-aff6b91ba2ab">2.8</ix:nonFraction> million for the year ended December 31, 2022, which is included in the General and Administrative costs of the condensed consolidated statements of operations.</span></div></ix:continuation><div id="ibb5d0eb17e77468eb79dc6027d5535b1_160"></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">Note 7 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="inpx:MergersAcquisitionsAndDispositionsDisclosuresAcquisition5TextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNjAvZnJhZzpjNDdjNWIyMDVlMmM0ZTY3YWEyYjZmYjI3YWM5MWQ3OS90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0N2M1YjIwNWUyYzRlNjdhYTJiNmZiMjdhYzkxZDc5XzE0MzE_bab9a9da-f271-480b-9968-0c0c74cbaaaa" continuedAt="i697d8a4367584fdfbff74ec9d97a7d15" escape="true">IntraNav Acquisition</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="i697d8a4367584fdfbff74ec9d97a7d15" continuedAt="i877c63d478384c6db8723d76e37e7053"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">On December 9, 2021, the Company, through its wholly owned subsidiary, Inpixon Germany, through its wholly owned subsidiary, Nanotron Technologies acquired IntraNav GmbH. IntraNav will bring new, comprehensive products and technologies, and a broad IP portfolio to strengthen the Company's established RTLS product line.  In exchange for a Purchase Price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i047500276d1946f98ab7fcfc730e79d8_I20211209" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedNet" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNjAvZnJhZzpjNDdjNWIyMDVlMmM0ZTY3YWEyYjZmYjI3YWM5MWQ3OS90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0N2M1YjIwNWUyYzRlNjdhYTJiNmZiMjdhYzkxZDc5XzM5NA_f8f6c5eb-08c7-436d-94c8-7167806ee136">1.1</ix:nonFraction> million, the Purchaser acquired all the outstanding shares of IntraNav. The goodwill of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i047500276d1946f98ab7fcfc730e79d8_I20211209" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNjAvZnJhZzpjNDdjNWIyMDVlMmM0ZTY3YWEyYjZmYjI3YWM5MWQ3OS90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0N2M1YjIwNWUyYzRlNjdhYTJiNmZiMjdhYzkxZDc5XzQ4Ng_5f1b17db-d295-4bfa-b1c5-b676c0452653">0.5</ix:nonFraction> million arising from the Acquisition consists of an acquired workforce, as well as synergies and economies of scale expected from combined operations of Nanotron and IntraNav.  </span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Acquisition is being accounted for as a business combination in accordance with ASC 805. The Company has determined the fair values of the assets acquired and liabilities assumed in the Acquisition.   The Company has made the allocation of the purchase price of the Acquisition to the assets acquired and the liabilities assumed as of the purchase date. <ix:continuation id="i5567cc5f1f0c48adbbad22b253319290" continuedAt="id83526570eb345be9a73f5e4ff580f7c">The following table summarizes the purchase price allocations relating to the Acquisition:</ix:continuation></span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><ix:continuation id="id83526570eb345be9a73f5e4ff580f7c"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:84.280%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.520%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Cash Considerations (EUR)</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">&#8364;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="eur" contextRef="ie41a17ef781d426d9eee03f3dfb7c903_D20211209-20211209" decimals="0" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesGross" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="_d5663156-2903-490e-b2ae-1e9ddad8817b">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Less: IntraNav's indebtedness in excess of EUR <ix:nonFraction unitRef="eur" contextRef="ie41a17ef781d426d9eee03f3dfb7c903_D20211209-20211209" decimals="-3" name="inpx:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredDebtExcessLimit" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="_046cc0ca-3425-4467-a7e6-b6d10fd34adf">150,000</ix:nonFraction></span></div></td><td colspan="2" style="padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="eur" contextRef="ie41a17ef781d426d9eee03f3dfb7c903_D20211209-20211209" decimals="0" name="inpx:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredDebtIncurredInExcessOfLimit" format="ixt:fixed-zero" scale="0" id="_bb3eaf7e-2b48-4315-a224-b1a54d182696">&#8212;</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 7pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Total Purchase Price (EUR)</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">&#8364;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="eur" contextRef="ie41a17ef781d426d9eee03f3dfb7c903_D20211209-20211209" decimals="0" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="_080f4a0e-662a-4326-bc36-ab59ae3fd334">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="padding-left:6pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Total Purchase Price (USD) - at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerEUR" contextRef="i047500276d1946f98ab7fcfc730e79d8_I20211209" decimals="INF" name="inpx:BusinessAcquisitionPurchasePriceMonetaryConversion" scale="0" id="_ad302dcd-0813-4073-ade1-7ef79f516238">1.13249</ix:nonFraction> USD per EUR</span></div></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie41a17ef781d426d9eee03f3dfb7c903_D20211209-20211209" decimals="0" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="_76a1d13e-e9db-4acd-ac75-d951a290d64c">1,132,490</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-37</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span sty