e="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie1b25e2df7ca44beae553be1ddf04901_I20221231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFvNiCost" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_eeb5c154-b030-4fea-9a67-2166164fa2c5">65,301</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td style="border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie1b25e2df7ca44beae553be1ddf04901_I20221231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFVNINoncurrent" scale="3" id="_9397f59b-3526-489e-9118-c7cd62156f2b">330</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">We entered into a note purchase agreement with Sysorex, as amended from time to time, pursuant to which we agreed to loan Sysorex up to an aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i90f34056d6fc497493fcb7ea9f5295f4_I20221231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:AggregateMaximumPrincipalAmountOfNoteReceivable" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzQ0NA_b38b6145-ee90-4d3c-b70e-516ec4524d78">10.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million on a revolving credit basis (the "Sysorex Note"). On March 1, 2020, we agreed to extend the maturity date of the note from December 31, 2020 to December 31, 2022.  On April 14, 2021, we entered into a Securities Settlement Agreement (the &#8220;SSA&#8221;) and a Rights Letter Agreement (the &#8220;RLA&#8221;), with Sysorex, whereby it  agreed to satisfy in full its outstanding debt, in the aggregate amount of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i2c27308179c44f8a91f586c63ee78ade_I20210331" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:NotesReceivableGross" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzg1MA_65ee6ca6-a9af-4b77-ad61-312b9f7b8c58">9.1</ix:nonFraction> million as of March 31, 2021, owed to the Company, including but, not limited to, amounts outstanding under the Sysorex Note (the &#8220;Debt Settlement&#8221;). To effect the Debt Settlement, Sysorex agreed to issue to us <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i159715daeccf443dad666413f7e655a7_D20210414-20210414" decimals="INF" name="inpx:StockReceivedDuringPeriodForDebtSettlementShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzEwNTY_ad7a5f1d-9844-46e3-8ed7-e84c3031f0d8">12,972,189</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock and rights to acquire <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i9984aeacf7a848cd8c5fe3c5a845c56b_D20210414-20210414" decimals="INF" name="inpx:StockReceivedDuringPeriodForDebtSettlementShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzExMDg_9f27d14f-f3f5-4938-9ef9-69a29e7eddb0">3,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock pursuant to the terms of the RLA. The Debt Settlement was entered into in connection with Sysorex&#8217;s closing of a reverse triangular merger with TTM Digital Assets &amp; Technologies, Inc.  As of December 31, 2022 and 2021 the fair value of the Sysorex shares and rights to acquire shares were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i7acf1f7e59ec4c60b7b5201b03a788ae_I20221231" decimals="-4" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFVNINoncurrent" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE0Mjc_e72e9739-9ecf-45cb-99a5-c359a13dfca0">0.01</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i6d8dfebe4802430abfbe57f9aecbfbd4_I20211231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFVNINoncurrent" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE0MzQ_393cc4f8-97df-48ab-b1aa-9831a6b48db7">1.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">On April 27, 2022, the Company purchased a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="ic3288031d2144adc9891a95a51e9d6cc_I20220427" decimals="2" name="inpx:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleDiscountPremiumPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE0OTY_c53244a1-f9de-488c-a117-cf116a7802da">10</ix:nonFraction>% convertible note in aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ic3288031d2144adc9891a95a51e9d6cc_I20220427" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:AvailableForSaleSecuritiesDebtSecurities" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE1NDk_a08d4cc5-3daa-4223-861c-76d88eb59cf5">6,050,000</ix:nonFraction> for a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i539f600c1860427aabc22e4a8e4c9d22_D20220427-20220427" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireAvailableForSaleSecuritiesDebt" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE1NzY_77c3f117-7153-4c0d-8e07-06d9247a37e4">5,500,000</ix:nonFraction> from FOXO Technologies Operating Company, formerly FOXO Technologies Inc. (&#8220;FOXO Legacy&#8221;), pursuant to the terms of a securities purchase agreement between FOXO Legacy and the Company (the &#8220;April 2022 Purchase Agreement&#8221;).  Interest on the convertible note accrues at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="ic3288031d2144adc9891a95a51e9d6cc_I20220427" decimals="2" name="inpx:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleInterestRate" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE4NDc_9aa6a698-a903-4990-aaf4-8c42cceacd57">12</ix:nonFraction>% per annum.  The term of the convertible note is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ic3288031d2144adc9891a95a51e9d6cc_I20220427" name="us-gaap:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleTerm" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE4OTg_58756056-3fc0-47ae-9b00-5a79eaaa02ff">twelve months</ix:nonNumeric>, however FOXO Legacy has the ability to extend the maturity date for an additional <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i539f600c1860427aabc22e4a8e4c9d22_D20220427-20220427" name="inpx:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleExtensionOptionTerm" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzE5ODQ_b88120a9-7041-41d9-bfb9-872feb65e569">3</ix:nonNumeric> months. The convertible note is subject to certain conversion features which include qualified financing, and/or qualified transaction, as defined in the April 2022 Purchase Agreement.  The Company can voluntarily convert the note after <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i539f600c1860427aabc22e4a8e4c9d22_D20220427-20220427" name="inpx:DebtSecuritiesAvailableForSaleConversionTerm" format="ixt-sec:durday" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzIyMTc_f2f2605d-74f0-4838-839a-0b346c6fdf0a">270</ix:nonNumeric> days.  The note is required to convert upon FOXO Legacy completing a qualified offering. </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-40</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div style="margin-top:9pt"><span><br/></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><ix:continuation id="i2fb34b046c844e70bce468a5d72715f2"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">On September 15, 2022, FOXO Legacy consummated a business combination with Delwinds Insurance Acquisition Corp., now known as FOXO Technologies Inc. ("FOXO"), which qualified as a qualified offering as defined in the April 2022 Purchase Agreement.  This qualified offering triggered a mandatory conversion of the convertible note to FOXO Legacy common stock which was then automatically converted into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i7f983d9923f44e37a23140dbbdcf98b5_D20220915-20220915" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzI3MDg_4bd2f7c8-d99c-4abc-b95b-d3c27438b613">891,124</ix:nonFraction> shares of FOXO Class A common stock, par value $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i6d0522b33406462e9ac827af59425165_I20220915" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzI3NTg_d8eb0a39-9923-40bc-ae0d-d23f2af81047">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> (&#8220;FOXO common stock&#8221;) upon closing of the business combination.  The Company recognized an unrealized gain on conversion of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i64e24bbf59a14ee99ee33a948359f3fb_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:GainOnConversionOfNoteReceivable" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzI4ODU_a2d09112-7114-4ef7-946b-c4df19c55f13">0.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million to be recognized in the statement of operations for the year ended December&#160;31, 2022.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">FOXO common stock is traded in active markets, as the security is trading under &#8220;FOXO&#8221; on the NYSE American.  FOXO common stock is accounted for as available-for-sale equity securities based on &#8220;Level&#8239;1&#8221; inputs, which consist of quoted prices in active markets, with unrealized holding gains and losses included in earnings.  The fair value was determined by the closing trading price of the security as of December 31, 2022.  The Company recognized an unrealized loss on FOXO common stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i133b0b3c76784b1a928d7262a6ac15df_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" sign="-" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFvNiUnrealizedGainLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzM0NTM_feee063a-2efe-4a79-96f7-050e5f2a46c3">6.1</ix:nonFraction> million to be recognized in the statement of operations for the year ended December&#160;31, 2022. As of December 31, 2022 and 2021 the fair value of the FOXO shares was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib23ecfaee27e4b02b3b72cfb10f21202_I20221231" decimals="-4" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFVNINoncurrent" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzM1OTg_08b89fcb-aac1-45af-aece-92ef0ba477a0">0.32</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and zero, respectively.</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">For the years ended December&#160;31, 2022 and 2021, the Company recognized a net unrealized loss on investments in equity securities of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" sign="-" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFvNiUnrealizedGainLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzM3NDE_2824d2f3-0887-4528-be5f-c5140a37d246">7.9</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i4defa292046241718f3fcecd2a906524_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" sign="-" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesFvNiUnrealizedGainLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzIvZnJhZzpmOWZhMjgwODU1MjI0N2U1YWI1YzI0NWNiZGYwNjBiMC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmY5ZmEyODA4NTUyMjQ3ZTVhYjVjMjQ1Y2JkZjA2MGIwXzM3NDg_4c72e1ef-d33f-4664-a43b-37e2d9edf9fc">57.1</ix:nonFraction> million on the statement of operations.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div id="ibb5d0eb17e77468eb79dc6027d5535b1_175"></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;fo