ne-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div style="margin-top:9pt"><span><br/></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 13 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="us-gaap:GoodwillAndIntangibleAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzgvZnJhZzpjNGY1YjI1YjJiN2Q0OWM0YmRjNDMwYjNiZWM4MzgyMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0ZjViMjViMmI3ZDQ5YzRiZGM0MzBiM2JlYzgzODIyXzM2NDk_5645e719-1523-4f67-95a0-14e2ce7407c4" continuedAt="iddf614ea7dd84faf846a5d820accfcdf" escape="true">Goodwill and Intangible Assets</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span><br/></span></div><ix:continuation id="iddf614ea7dd84faf846a5d820accfcdf" continuedAt="iccba8a7b674d4c6f8c32729083237fb3"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">The Company reviews goodwill for impairment on a reporting unit basis on December 31 of each year and whenever events or changes in circumstances indicate the carrying value of goodwill may not be recoverable.  The Company&#8217;s significant assumptions in these analyses include, but are not limited to, project revenue, the weighted average cost of capital, the terminal growth rate, derived multiples from comparable market transactions and other market data. The Company's goodwill balance and other assets with indefinite lives were evaluated for potential goodwill impairment on a reporting unit basis during the period ended June 30, 2022, as certain indications on a qualitative and a quantitative basis were identified that an impairment exists as of the reporting date primarily from a sustained decrease in their stock price.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company utilized a mix of both the income and market approaches in determining the fair value of the reporting units.  The Company noted that <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="if5f37eb0500946e3b1055a6f736e9170_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:ReportingUnitMeasurementInput" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzgvZnJhZzpjNGY1YjI1YjJiN2Q0OWM0YmRjNDMwYjNiZWM4MzgyMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0ZjViMjViMmI3ZDQ5YzRiZGM0MzBiM2JlYzgzODIyXzEwMjU_ef2a7e02-b6c2-4534-a8a5-cb2584c777ff">50</ix:nonFraction>% weight was attributed to the income approach and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i1961a9c91353465491049733b489404c_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:ReportingUnitMeasurementInput" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzgvZnJhZzpjNGY1YjI1YjJiN2Q0OWM0YmRjNDMwYjNiZWM4MzgyMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0ZjViMjViMmI3ZDQ5YzRiZGM0MzBiM2JlYzgzODIyXzEwNzc_eb435706-b867-4760-ac5a-5bb4075f8caa">50</ix:nonFraction>% was attributed to the market approach. </span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During the year ended December&#160;31, 2022, the Company recognized approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:GoodwillImpairmentLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzgvZnJhZzpjNGY1YjI1YjJiN2Q0OWM0YmRjNDMwYjNiZWM4MzgyMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0ZjViMjViMmI3ZDQ5YzRiZGM0MzBiM2JlYzgzODIyXzExODQ_f48e1845-e87f-4cc0-82e0-7f3848903d98">7.6</ix:nonFraction> million of goodwill impairment on Systat, GTX, Nanotron, Jibestream, CXApp, Game Your Game, and IntraNav. During the year ended December&#160;31, 2022, the Company's cumulative impairment charges are approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:GoodwillCumulativeImpairmentLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzgvZnJhZzpjNGY1YjI1YjJiN2Q0OWM0YmRjNDMwYjNiZWM4MzgyMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0ZjViMjViMmI3ZDQ5YzRiZGM0MzBiM2JlYzgzODIyXzEzNzM_5a7b363c-6058-4f2f-87a6-9ad88f949008">31.0</ix:nonFraction> million with approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i0a069bfeb69f47ae90fcc1e6f51a14fe_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:GoodwillImpairmentLoss" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xNzgvZnJhZzpjNGY1YjI1YjJiN2Q0OWM0YmRjNDMwYjNiZWM4MzgyMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmM0ZjViMjViMmI3ZDQ5YzRiZGM0MzBiM2JlYzgzODIyXzEzOTU_e3322189-cc49-471a-ab02-8060e409588e">29.1