f="i0e4eb8e0ce8a43dcb2f9d5180afbb461_I20221231" decimals="3" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="_9799adba-686b-463b-ba39-172bf0504a4c">14.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">%</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Units </span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">CVH LLC Class B</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i17d5c5e504e5454a8df52dddb959b341_I20221231" decimals="3" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="_2d123a49-6c03-4f5a-b3db-5d8b38794cdd">38.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">%</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Units</span></td></tr></table></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company performed a valuation over the CVH units and determined that the Company's investment in CVH is impaired.  The Company believes that the impairment is other than temporary, due to the significant difference between the carrying value and fair value and the Company's plan to dispose of the investment in February 2023, which plan was carried out (See below and see Note 32).  Therefore, the Company recognized an impairment on the Company's investment in CVH of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ia3684c3ae8a44d9c99d2db4dd46ed417_D20221231-20221231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOtherThanTemporaryImpairment" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xODEvZnJhZzo2MTEzYWMwMzRmNjU0NzEyYTMyMmRmYWY5OGExMjUzNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjYxMTNhYzAzNGY2NTQ3MTJhMzIyZGZhZjk4YTEyNTM3XzI0NDg_fca7122b-ccec-4ff3-833f-61c3c9b82723">1.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million as of December 31, 2022.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Inpixon&#8217;s investment in equity method eligible entities are represented on the balance sheet as an asset of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie1b25e2df7ca44beae553be1ddf04901_I20221231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xODEvZnJhZzo2MTEzYWMwMzRmNjU0NzEyYTMyMmRmYWY5OGExMjUzNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjYxMTNhYzAzNGY2NTQ3MTJhMzIyZGZhZjk4YTEyNTM3XzI1ODQ_4ad85745-97e9-47e7-99b1-c68b48990280">0.7</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ic1bc9cf9dabb422eb1a4bdfce85db9c9_I20211231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xODEvZnJhZzo2MTEzYWMwMzRmNjU0NzEyYTMyMmRmYWY5OGExMjUzNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjYxMTNhYzAzNGY2NTQ3MTJhMzIyZGZhZjk4YTEyNTM3XzI1OTE_e2aba1c2-baf2-4335-99ac-6553d8b9ebbe">2.5</ix:nonFraction> million as of December&#160;31, 2022 and December&#160;31, 2021, respectively. Ownership interest in equity method eligible entities did not change from the year ended December&#160;31, 2021 to December&#160;31, 2022.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">On July 1, 2022, the Company loaned $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="iceca61ccb97e4d0cb788d54534a4ef42_D20220701-20220701" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionAmountsOfTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xODEvZnJhZzo2MTEzYWMwMzRmNjU0NzEyYTMyMmRmYWY5OGExMjUzNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjYxMTNhYzAzNGY2NTQ3MTJhMzIyZGZhZjk4YTEyNTM3XzI3NjA_bd21262b-3adf-47f1-831d-3f85a2e5ac3b">150,000</ix:nonFraction> to CVH. The loan bears no interest and is due and payable in full on the earlier of: (i) the date by which KINS has to complete a merger, capital stock exchange, asset acquisition, stock purchase, reorganization or similar business combination with one or more businesses (a &#8220;business combination&#8221;), and (ii) immediately prior to the date of consummation of the business combination of KINS, unless accelerated upon the occurrence of an event of default. Nadir Ali, the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer and director, is also a member in CVH through 3AM, LLC, which is a member of CVH, and which may, in certain circumstances, be entitled to manage the affairs of CVH. As a result of the closing of the Business Combination, the loan was repaid on March 15, 2023.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"><ix:continuation id="icd0c4a15334f489195124f1422806503">On February 27, 2023, the Company entered into Limited Liability Company Unit Transfer and Joinder Agreements with certain of the Company&#8217;s employees and directors (the &#8220;Transferees&#8221;), pursuant to which (i) the Company transferred all of its Class A Units of CVH (the &#8220;Class A Units&#8221;), an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ie4690ea9abe6400f8769b99e69a82dcf_D20230227-20230227" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xODEvZnJhZzo2MTEzYWMwMzRmNjU0NzEyYTMyMmRmYWY5OGExMjUzNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjYxMTNhYzAzNGY2NTQ3MTJhMzIyZGZhZjk4YTEyNTM3XzM4Mjk_ab18a118-5b6f-443d-9d03-9b648c888b98">599,999</ix:nonFraction> Class A Units, to the Transferees as bonus consideration in connection with each Transferee&#8217;s services performed for and on behalf of the Company as an employee, as applicable, and (ii) each Transferee became a member of CVH and a party to the Amended and Restated Limited Liability Company Agreement of CVH, dated as of September 30, 2020.</ix:continuation>  </span></div><div id="ibb5d0eb17e77468eb79dc6027d5535b1_184"></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-46</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 15 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="inpx:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xODQvZnJhZzpkZGMxMjlmMzZhMDU0MjlkOTMxY2M0YTc3MjZmYzM4OS90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmRkYzEyOWYzNmEwNTQyOWQ5MzFjYzRhNzcyNmZjMzg5XzE5MQ_980856fa-ae4a-41fa-af60-c44c442dce7c" continuedAt="i024fd77ef0e04f76aceb815041c2ccb5" escape="true">Deferred Revenue</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="i024fd77ef0e04f76aceb815041c2ccb5"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerAssetAndLiabilityTableTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiN