ng balance of the March 2020 <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i4335eea89ae045b2b933c384990abfb9_I20200318" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEyODEy_5996c512-0b93-431f-9bbd-bf7f799dc035">10</ix:nonFraction>% Note to be reduced by approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i346a222415b04976892b1cf27a6acdcb_D20221017-20221017" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:NotesReduction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEyODUx_68aaffe2-9eb7-4fdd-8f24-cb9c25864a18">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million; and (ii) exchange the partitioned note for the delivery of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i346a222415b04976892b1cf27a6acdcb_D20221017-20221017" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEyOTE0_5143bea5-1a84-4968-bc0a-595d9b655bc3">83,682</ix:nonFraction>  shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, at an effective price per share equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i119a26ea791b47f18e64b9bf8bb513a9_I20221017" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEyOTk3_0aac3c39-0944-4d06-afeb-b407117ec464">4.78</ix:nonFraction>.  The Company analyzed the exchange of the principal under the March 2020 <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i4335eea89ae045b2b933c384990abfb9_I20200318" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEzMDc0_5fcc4a8e-ca51-435b-9f6c-b92e8bededed">10</ix:nonFraction>% Note as an extinguishment and compared the net carrying value of the debt being extinguished to the reacquisition price (shares of common stock being issued) and there was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i20f1eb376357486cb4caad2ce3c691dd_D20221017-20221017" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" format="ixt:fixed-zero" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEzMjQ5_1b634122-7f0f-4bd7-bced-d00b11800a34">no</ix:nonFraction> loss on the exchange for debt for equity.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Subsequent to year end, the Company entered into additional exchange agreements with Illiad and the note has been satisfied in full. See Note 32 for details.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:115%">July 2022  Note Purchase Agreement and Promissory Note</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">On July 22, 2022, the Company entered into a note purchase agreement (the "Purchase Agreement") with Streeterville Capital, LLC (the &#8220;Holder&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company agreed to issue and sell to the Holder an unsecured promissory note (the &#8220;July 2022 Note&#8221;) in an aggregate initial principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i223a8e7b22aa473da508e2329ca8c359_I20220722" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEzODE3_5bb1218c-0d2d-46d8-b022-72cf5a4e1b3d">6.5</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Initial Principal Amount&#8221;), which is payable on or before the date that is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i5946d27e8e1d42158b01fe63194b4fdb_D20220722-20220722" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzEzOTAx_116e19b6-74c5-4f37-ab45-e863571707fd">12</ix:nonNumeric> months from the issuance date (the &#8220;Maturity Date&#8221;). The Initial Principal Amount includes an original issue discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i223a8e7b22aa473da508e2329ca8c359_I20220722" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE0MDE4_14792b00-ef1b-4316-a6ce-939b8bb746ef">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i223a8e7b22aa473da508e2329ca8c359_I20220722" decimals="-4" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFeeAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE0MDI1_970bc807-2ef0-4329-b81f-fd1c6a9740c6">0.02</ix:nonFraction> million that the Company agreed to pay to the Holder to cover the Holder&#8217;s legal fees, accounting costs, due diligence, monitoring and other transaction costs. In exchange for the Note, the Holder paid an aggregate purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i5946d27e8e1d42158b01fe63194b4fdb_D20220722-20220722" decimals="-5" name="inpx:PaymentForNotePurchaseAgreement" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE0MjUz_1138d17c-d29c-421a-8b8d-8dc4ccbc1101">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Transaction&#8221;).  Interest on the Note accrued at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i223a8e7b22aa473da508e2329ca8c359_I20220722" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE0MzIw_260ebc22-245c-490f-aa68-a3709e64628d">10</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, which is payable on the maturity date.  We may pay all or any portion of the amount owed earlier than it is due; provided that in the event we may elect to prepay all or any portion of the outstanding balance, it shall pay to the Holder <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i102a27ffccc4432ea66dd66916a3034f_D20220722-20220722" decimals="INF" name="inpx:DebtInstrumentPaymentToBeMadeInProportionToOutstandingBalancePercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE0NTcx_38a6d513-ea33-46c1-bd23-20b88a4733c0">115</ix:nonFraction>% of the portion of the outstanding balance we may elect to prepay. Beginning on the date that is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i5946d27e8e1d42158b01fe63194b4fdb_D20220722-20220722" name="inpx:DebtInstrumentRedemptionTerm" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE0Njcw_6044fbf3-aa8b-48ca-80d2-1457968f21fd">6</ix:nonNumeric> months from the issue date and at the intervals indicated below until the Note is paid in full, the Holder shall have the right to redeem up to an aggregate of 1/3 of the initial principal balance of the Note for cash each month.  The July 2022 Note includes customary event of default provisions, subject to certain cure periods, and provides for a default interest rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="icb4d8cc0e0314020a5e53de7c49ac9ce_I20220722" decimals="2" name="inpx:DefaultInterestRate" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE1MDQx_98346298-b025-4a27-86f9-db0170d412e3">22</ix:nonFraction>%. Upon the occurrence of an event of default (except default due to the occurrence of bankruptcy or insolvency proceedings), the Holder may, by written notice, declare all unpaid principal, plus all accrued interest and other amounts due under the July 2022 Note to be immediately due and payable. Upon the occurrence of bankruptcy-related event of default, without notice, all unpaid principal, plus all accrued interest and other amounts due under the July 2022 Note will become immediately due and payable at the mandatory default amount.  Under the terms of the July 2022 Note, if the note is still outstanding after <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i102a27ffccc4432ea66dd66916a3034f_D20220722-20220722" name="inpx:DebtInstrumentRedemptionTerm" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE1NjY0_d08ee84a-6aca-44b5-a942-5f897d513c2d">6</ix:nonNumeric> months from the issuance date, or as of January 22, 2023, a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="icb4d8cc0e0314020a5e53de7c49ac9ce_I20220722" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE1NzIw_3cd15f97-e821-4884-9743-30a0bf1cad74">10</ix:nonFraction>% monitoring fee would be added to the balance of the note.  On January 31, 2023, the Holder agreed to reduce the one time monitoring fee from <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i4335eea89ae045b2b933c384990abfb9_I20200318" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE1ODY0_1aade08c-4357-41aa-8af4-e6ad09383f87">10</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i7ba501fa07db4317a7b5630e613755fa_I20200917" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE1ODcw_ddaa145a-4c79-4347-a6ab-50842b7b2b3d">5</ix:nonFraction>%.  The Company accrued the pro-rata portion of the monitoring fee of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie1b25e2df7ca44beae553be1ddf04901_I20221231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:DebtInstrumentAccruedMonitoringFee" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE1OTQx_47d73986-9a44-41bc-8cf0-8cac0d6e2472">0.3</ix:nonFraction> million as of December 31, 2022 which added to the note balance.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:112%">December 2022 Note Purchase Agreement and Promissory Note</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">On December 30, 2022, we entered into a note purchase agreement with Streeterville Capital, LLC (the "Holder"), pursuant to which we agreed to issue and sell to the Holder an unsecured promissory note (the "December 2022 Note") in an aggregate initial principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i53d99ec07584434e87d81dab5970cb1b_I20221230" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE2MzMy_681842f9-e5e2-43dd-b38f-be630afa0b4d">8.4</ix:nonFraction> million, which is payable on or before the date that is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i4bc5b3ca8ba5421696d4aed816321d22_D20221230-20221230" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE2Mzgz_3e7b2b20-4184-4c4a-8bda-47918ff856f0">12</ix:nonNumeric> months from the issuance date. The initial principal amount of includes an original issue discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i53d99ec07584434e87d81dab5970cb1b_I20221230" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE2NDgx_ab7fbdd1-9dcd-4ed0-bdd9-7fececee7d51">1.9</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i53d99ec07584434e87d81dab5970cb1b_I20221230" decimals="-4" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFeeAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE2NDg4_a80ebd6c-9d83-4cde-905a-aca14b28809f">0.02</ix:nonFraction> million that we agreed to pay to the Holder to cover the Holder's legal fees, accounting costs, due diligence, monitoring and other transaction costs. In exchange for the Note, the Holder paid an aggregate purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i4bc5b3ca8ba5421696d4aed816321d22_D20221230-20221230" decimals="-5" name="inpx:PaymentForNotePurchaseAgreement" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE2NzA3_d95f9eb3-b208-4bd1-a0d4-9c708f3593dd">6.5</ix:nonFraction> million. </span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Interest on the December 2022 Note accrues at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="ib30a838dee6d4b29bff469049eba1ec7_I20221231" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE2NzY5_4afa70da-d0c6-4271-9100-58e40c0a374d">10</ix:nonFraction>% per annum and is payable on the maturity date or otherwise in accordance with the December 2022 Note. We may pay all or any portion of the amount owed earlier than it is due; provided that in the event we may elect to prepay all or any portion of the outstanding balance, it shall pay to the Holder <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i03b07ef4986e4a0fa426a11e02078179_D20221201-20221231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:DebtInstrumentPaymentToBeMadeInProportionToOutstandingBalancePercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE3MDcx_2d40145e-8e7d-4892-b103-eb8f2bd52a1f">115</ix:nonFraction>% of the portion of the outstanding balance we may elect to prepay. Beginning on the date that is <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ic9e2e79e0b04484098e7f9da48681fbf_D20221201-20221231" name="inpx:DebtInstrumentRedemptionTerm" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE3MTcw_eca1c56a-abe7-4a6e-a77d-91f4104c58c6">6</ix:nonNumeric> months from the issuance date and at the intervals indicated below until the December 2022 Note is paid in full, the Holder shall have the right to redeem up to an aggregate of 1/6th of the initial principal balance of the December 2022 Note plus any interest accrued thereunder each month by providing written notice delivered to us; provided, however, that if the Holder does not exercise any monthly redemption amount in its corresponding month then such monthly redemption amount shall be available for the Holder to redeem in any further month in addition to such future month's monthly redemption amount.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">  </span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Upon receipt of any monthly redemption notice, we shall pay the applicable monthly redemption amount in cash to the Holder within five (5) business days of the Company's receipt of such monthly redemption notice. The December 2022 Note includes </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-51</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div style="margin-top:9pt"><span><br/></span></div></div><ix:continuation id="i85cf0af97d464ce2aaffbc4e4d982883"><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">customary event of default provisions, subject to certain cure periods, and provides for a default interest rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i8aac246eff5041f0b2c773b221c4ec4d_I20221231" decimals="2" name="inpx:DefaultInterestRate" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE4MTQx_0009d1ff-21a0-48a2-8bfa-34491a530650">22</ix:nonFraction>%. Upon the occurrence of an event of default (except default due to the occurrence of bankruptcy or insolvency proceedings), the Holder may, by written notice, declare all unpaid principal, plus all accrued interest and other amounts due under the December 2022 Note to be immediately due and payable. Upon the occurrence of bankruptcy-related event of default, without notice, all unpaid principal, plus all accrued interest and other amounts due under the December 2022 Note will become immediately due and payable at the mandatory default amount. </span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:115%">Third Party Notes Payable</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Game Your Game, the Company's subsidiary, entered into promissory notes with an individual whereby it received approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ia2fa2ae6c3aa43409e178168a7831e2f_I20211029" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTAvZnJhZzozOWYwMjg2OTkyMmI0NWE2YWY5OGQ0MGIzNTgxMjkyNy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5ZjAyODY5OTIyYjQ1YTZhZjk4ZDQwYjM1ODEyOTI3XzE4ODQ2_782593f4-760f-423c-969a-b65920a136d5">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million on October 29, 2021, approximately $<ix