sdPerShare" contextRef="iff03395d54dd4481845862ebf8608517_I20210216" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzI3NzE_9a9858c2-73cd-4fd7-b49e-04426b2cac00">0.08</ix:nonFraction> per share, at a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="iff03395d54dd4481845862ebf8608517_I20210216" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzI4MDg_4424af66-e9f8-4fee-8990-69542e9e226c">150.68</ix:nonFraction> per share. At closing the Company received approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie9cbb6c83ac0455683f785e13d2f5c42_D20210216-20210216" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzI4Njg_a5acd9a8-b556-4202-9512-a6a99d71cfd1">18.5</ix:nonFraction> million in net proceeds after deducting placement agent commissions and offering expenses. Each Second February 2021 Purchase Warrant and Second February 2021 Pre-funded Warrant is or was immediately exercisable for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="iff03395d54dd4481845862ebf8608517_I20210216" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzMwNzk_3d2250f1-8279-4318-a3d4-44bb6508390e">one</ix:nonFraction> share of common stock for a period until the, <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i803e41aff6264817be70bca61cf68def_D20210216-20210216" name="inpx:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardExercisablePeriod" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzEyOTI4_1305ca7b-bfe9-4259-89ea-16bfb4fdb4cf">five year</ix:nonNumeric> anniversary of the issuance date. The Second February 2021 Pre-funded warrants were exercised in full as of March 1, 2021.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On September 13, 2021, the Company entered into a Securities Purchase Agreement with certain institutional investors named therein, pursuant to which the Company sold in a registered direct offering (i)  <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="iaad80f267035422a8705a158489737a2_D20210913-20210913" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzM0NjM_67bbd20d-90f3-4343-acc1-bfa2f87ddb75">58,750</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series 7 Convertible Preferred </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-52</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 18 - Capital Raises (continued)</span></div></div><ix:continuation id="i88d704a6b3864f569670bf8c9fd9f8ba" continuedAt="i4169feea530e4abb8cd8bb2c613eb2c8"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Stock and (ii) related warrants to purchase up to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i8e86e414d1464827a90c2759be416d47_D20210913-20210913" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzM1NzM_0f6d25e0-3e54-49b9-9d29-fcfb61ce7a4d">626,667</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock. Each share of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock and the related Warrants were sold at a subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="iffd1a7f98f464cb7926edeb8e1accd49_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzM3MTQ_033f8750-1061-4138-8320-ac4df2fd151c">920</ix:nonFraction>, representing an original issue discount of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="iffd1a7f98f464cb7926edeb8e1accd49_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionOriginalIssuanceDiscount" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzM3NjE_3a886da9-5446-45d4-ace4-a00aeb5102ed">8</ix:nonFraction>% of the stated value of each share of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock for an aggregate subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="iffd1a7f98f464cb7926edeb8e1accd49_I20210913" decimals="-5" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionAggregateValue" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzM4Nzg_b1b3ef92-90e8-4763-a7ce-d6b099a243e8">54.1</ix:nonFraction> million. In connection with this offering, the Company filed a Certificate of Designation for the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock with the Nevada Secretary of State. The Company has authorized the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ie1b25e2df7ca44beae553be1ddf04901_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzQwODc_11951d27-2858-430d-974f-4e1731e8c848">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of preferred stock, of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ifdab88925ec249828fa1b6157f25bb50_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzQxMjY_4b45df26-60da-47fe-939b-e594fa047166"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ifdab88925ec249828fa1b6157f25bb50_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzQxMjY_ce816d64-49f3-4a5b-90c6-41dede4ec169">0</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> shares were issued and outstanding as of December&#160;31, 2022. Each share of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock has a par value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i32f7fb3a6a6d4bdeb8876fd871e64b52_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:TemporaryEquityParValuePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xO