es of the Company&#8217;s common stock. At any time beginning on October 1, 2022 and ending ninety 90 days thereafter, the holders of the Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock have the right to redeem all or part of the shares held by such holder in cash for the redemption price equal to the stated value of such share, plus all accrued but unpaid dividends thereon and all liquidated damages and other costs, expenses or amounts due. Upon redemption, the holder of the Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">  </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">will forfeit <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i2d7c2735fae942cbb677dfc693bdab27_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:EquityInstrumentsSharesForfeitedUponRedemptionPercent" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzc5Njg_386c70ec-66cf-4e4a-bf27-9a56d1b9fefb">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the warrants issued in connection therewith. The holders of the Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock shall vote together with all other classes and series of stock of the Company as a single class on all actions to be taken by the stockholders of the Company. The Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock and related warrants subject to forfeiture are recorded as Mezzanine Equity in the accompanying balance sheets as the holder has the option to redeem these shares for cash and the warrants are an embedded feature for the Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock. The remaining warrants that are not subject to forfeiture are recorded within Stockholders' Equity as the remaining warrants are classified as freestanding instruments containing a total value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib2fee1e5f827446badbda95ddb18ff47_I20220322" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstanding" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzg3MzA_5fc3d510-9208-43b3-a3bf-6ca4037d2147">5.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">  </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The aggregate net proceeds from the offering, after deducting the placement agent fees and other estimated offering expenses, were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="if25b6e2131d54b5cac3e3fb1d576cf9f_D20220322-20220322" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPreferredStockPreferenceStockAndWarrants" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzg4ODA_052f8ec1-256f-4b4e-a02d-8c2ce7fb8c9a">46.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">See Note 20 for Preferred Stock and Note 23 for Warrant details.  During the quarter ended December 31, 2022, the Company received cash redemption notices from the holders of the Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock issued on March 22, 2022, totaling <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRe