olders of the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock issued on September 15, 2021, totaling <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ib911675815594b97a467ca57afa54273_D20220315-20220322" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzk1MTI_0c0ca50d-d4fc-4155-a3d4-1d01cec43875">49,250</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock for aggregate cash required to be paid of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib911675815594b97a467ca57afa54273_D20220315-20220322" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodValue" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzk2MTg_3124dd6f-e7d2-4a1e-91cd-08fc81593907">49.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. In addition, in accordance with the related purchase </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-53</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 18 - Capital Raises (continued)</span></div></div><ix:continuation id="i4169feea530e4abb8cd8bb2c613eb2c8" continuedAt="ie8bdb6433ddf41ef8a2845efce99a2b2"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">agreement, upon redemption of the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock, each holder forfeited <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i34837b40b15744dd96fe25059d144076_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:EquityInstrumentsSharesForfeitedUponRedemptionPercent" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzk3Njk_20f7b087-900d-40e7-b77e-0d4429f3f45b">75</ix:nonFraction>% of the related warrants that were issued. Therefore, as of March 22, 2022, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ib911675815594b97a467ca57afa54273_D20220315-20220322" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzk4NDc_3b18be30-f435-45a3-b45f-464d401a6c9a">49,250</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock were redeemed and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i5cf5011017064678add995938375569d_D20220315-20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:ClassOrRightOfWarrantForfeitures" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzk5MTU_127b0c6b-2bd1-4898-b57a-a5ab2ecddf0b">394,000</ix:nonFraction> related warrants were forfeited.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">  </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company noted about <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i5cf5011017064678add995938375569d_D20220315-20220322" decimals="2" name="inpx:EquityInstrumentsSharedHoldersParticipantsPercent" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4Xzk5NzY_2ca7f443-8975-45dd-b3d1-5e128878bdca">71</ix:nonFraction>% of the Series 7 Preferred Stock holders that redeemed shares also participated as Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock holders (&#8220;shared holders&#8221;). The Company accounted for proceeds of the shared holders as a modification to the Series 7 and Series 8 Convertible Preferred Stock, as well as the related embedded warrants. The total change in fair value as a result of modification related to the Preferred Stock amounted to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i5cf5011017064678add995938375569d_D20220315-20220322" decimals="-5" sign="-" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquityDividendsAdjustment" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzEwNDAz_726758ca-5a4a-4421-b5dd-8db34badf28b">2.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million which were recognized as a deemed dividend at the date of the modification, upon which will be amortized until the redemption period begins on October 1, 2022.  The total change in fair value as a result of modification related to the embedded warrants amounted to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i5cf5011017064678add995938375569d_D20220315-20220322" decimals="-5" name="inpx:TemporaryEquityDeemedContributionOfWarrantsIssuedAdjustment" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzEwNjcx_8b7f7a92-2780-4ca3-b310-cdd43731543f">1.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million which was recognized as a deemed contribution at the date of the modification, upon which will be accreted until the redemption period begins on October 1, 2022. </span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On July 22, 2022, the Company entered into an Equity Distribution Agreement (the "Sales Agreement") with Maxim Group LLC (&#8220;Maxim&#8221;) under which the Company may offer and sell shares of its common stock having an aggregate offering price of up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ida08869ade484c65acd63b3f095666cb_D20220722-20220722" decimals="-6" name="inpx:SaleOfStockMaximumPotentialOffering" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzExMDgz_ddd71953-1129-41f6-8585-e2d59bc431d7">25</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million (the &#8220;Shares&#8221;) from time to time through Maxim, acting exclusively as the Company&#8217;s sales agent (the &#8220;Offering&#8221;).   The Company intends to use the net proceeds of the Offering primarily for working capital and general corporate purposes. The Company did not make any sales pursuant to the Sales Agreement as of December 31, 2022, however, has raised gross proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ie4d967bf8413489c85a3d0e78777616d_D20230101-20230331" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzExNDY4_3887b95f-e693-4293-9fc0-df53dbcdb795">15.4</ix:nonFraction> million under the Sales Agreement as of March 14, 2023.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"><ix:continuation id="ie8bdb6433ddf41ef8a2845efce99a2b2">On October 18, 2022, the Company entered into a Securities Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;Purchase Agreement&#8221;) with an institutional investor named therein (the &#8220;Purchaser&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company agreed to issue and sell, in a registered direct offering, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" co