Purchaser&#8217;s election. Each pre-funded warrant is exercisable for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i607cbe54d0e14b5a99395f11feb8328b_I20221018" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzEyOTI2_3cc1106f-e0d8-4c92-83b6-a85c68fffc00">one</ix:nonFraction> share of common stock. The purchase price of each pre-funded warrant was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ia3a3f8942af54772921b16d30e4aab27_I20221018" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzEyNDYz_3d9f86f7-6b77-46c4-bf5c-db2d565c7d02">5.849</ix:nonFraction>, and the exercise price of each pre-funded warrant is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i64e86c31d2a6485f9ae364415a78486e_I20221018" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8xOTYvZnJhZzo3OTQ1YzI5NjAyODY0NTg0YTdiMThhZjE2MGVkNWY5OC90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjc5NDVjMjk2MDI4NjQ1ODRhN2IxOGFmMTYwZWQ1Zjk4XzEyNTIw_41e04af8-71b2-4572-b3a6-c34d2889d4e5">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share. The pre-funded warrants are immediately exercisable and may be exercised at any time until all of the pre-funded warrants are exercised in full.  The Company raised net proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i186ba39a9b7f4ab29fc81c107e2c3b88_D20221018-20221018" decimals="-5" name="inpx:Pro