 designated the preferences, rights and limitations of the Series 5 Convertible Preferred Stock. The Series 5 Convertible Preferred Stock is non-voting (except to the extent required by law). The Series 5 Convertible Preferred Stock is convertible into the number of shares of Common Stock, determined by dividing the aggregate stated value of the Series 5 Convertible Preferred Stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i96f9496ef99c45ff8862210b171c0b7a_I20190114" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzE1ODg_557541b9-37ac-4313-a12a-17ad7ea6bf25">1,000</ix:nonFraction> per share to be converted by $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i96f9496ef99c45ff8862210b171c0b7a_I20190114" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SeriesPreferredStockConversionValue" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzE2MjA_e872e34b-dc61-4827-a326-f7f86528f063">11,238.75</ix:nonFraction>.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">As of December&#160;31, 2022, there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i0f59d0545e914f3f91d074176aa0838a_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzE2NDU_5b640aba-cf87-4804-a9f5-68c9bd77863b">126</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series 5 Convertible Preferred Stock outstanding.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On September 13, 2021, the Company filed the Certificate of Designation with the Secretary of State of the State of Nevada, amending the Company&#8217;s Articles of Incorporation, as amended, by establishing the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock, consisting of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i32f7fb3a6a6d4bdeb8876fd871e64b52_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzIwMDM_7d15acd9-c7a5-4c7c-8cd5-fc6322c44a42">58,750</ix:nonFraction> authorized shares, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i32f7fb3a6a6d4bdeb8876fd871e64b52_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:TemporaryEquityParValuePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzIwMjY_2d808097-c347-4c41-b901-6295db36db9c">0.001</ix:nonFraction> par value per share and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i32f7fb3a6a6d4bdeb8876fd871e64b52_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:TemporaryEquityStatedValuePerShare" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzIwNTQ_f00a320f-ee0a-4f14-9996-9f1762402269">1,000</ix:nonFraction> stated value per share.  The holders of the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock have full voting rights and powers, except as otherwise required by the Articles of Incorporation, as amended, or applicable law. The holders of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock shall vote together with all other classes and series of stock of the Company as a single class on all actions to be taken by the stockholders of the Company. Each holder of the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock shall be entitled to the number of votes equal to the number of shares of common stock into which the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock then held by such holder could be converted on the record date for the vote which is being taken, provided, however, that the voting power of a holder together with its Attribution Parties (as defined in the Certificate of Designation), may not exceed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i1bf8b0f0ecd64c57bcf8f7ee2e271e4b_D20210913-20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:TemporaryEquityConversionBasisMaximumVotingPowerPerHolder" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzI5MjY_ffe9eea5-3947-4f87-8e9c-d2062d182943">19.99</ix:nonFraction>% (or such greater percentage allowed by the Nasdaq Listing Rules without any shareholder approval requirements). The Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock is convertible into the number of shares of common stock, determined by dividing the aggregate stated value of the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i32f7fb3a6a6d4bdeb8876fd871e64b52_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:TemporaryEquityStatedValuePerShare" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzMyMzg_f00a320f-ee0a-4f14-9996-9f1762402269">1,000</ix:nonFraction> per share to be converted by $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i32f7fb3a6a6d4bdeb8876fd871e64b52_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:TemporaryEquityConvertibleConversionPrice" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzMyNzE_eda8c5bb-0f79-47a4-94f4-ecee595752b5">93.75</ix:nonFraction>. </span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On September 13, 2021, the Company entered into a Securities Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;Purchase Agreement&#8221;) with certain institutional investors named therein, pursuant to which the Company agreed to issue and sell in a registered direct offering  (i) up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i32f7fb3a6a6d4bdeb8876fd871e64b52_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzM1MzM_7d15acd9-c7a5-4c7c-8cd5-fc6322c44a42">58,750</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock and (ii) related warrants to purchase up to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i8e86e414d1464827a90c2759be416d47_D20210913-20210913" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzM2NDM_06142267-5594-46c7-b848-4657ceef82be">626,667</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock (the &#8220;Warrants&#8221;). Each share of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock and the related Warrants (see Note 26) were sold at a subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="iffd1a7f98f464cb7926edeb8e1accd49_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzM4MTU_4a6b70a0-3578-4438-98b4-08b0c2cccd2b">920</ix:nonFraction>, representing an original issue discount of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="iffd1a7f98f464cb7926edeb8e1accd49_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionOriginalIssuanceDiscount" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzM4NjI_2fb2d3b1-e87d-47b3-afb7-c9d72d4303f3">8</ix:nonFraction>% of the stated value for an aggregate subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="iffd1a7f98f464cb7926edeb8e1accd49_I20210913" decimals="-5" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionAggregateValue" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzM5MjU_956042d3-af44-4134-8217-e011e0b16143">54.1</ix:nonFraction> million. The shares of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stocks are recorded as Mezzanine Equity in the accompanying balance sheets as the holder has the option to redeem these shares for cash. The aggregate net proceeds from the offering, after deducting the placement agent fees and other estimated offering expenses, was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ieaa0832c8fa04c5fafdd027f5acc86fc_D20210913-20210913" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPreferredStockPreferenceStockAndWarrants" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzQyNTU_bdc79cf8-5151-4e50-a077-c99bd5337e18">50.6</ix:nonFraction> million. The Company has elected to accrete the issuance costs, discount, and freestanding warrants through the date shares can be first be redeemed at the option of the holders, which is the sixth month anniversary of the Original Issuance Date using the effective interest method. </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-56</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 20 - Preferred Stock (continued)</span></div></div><ix:continuation id="i27bd8d5995a64fb8acb69bf310796883"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During the year ended December&#160;31, 2021, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="id6ca63adb2ae4b848dfd9b1a35d6d874_D20210101-20211231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMDgvZnJhZzozOWJmYmM0NGVjOWE0YzczYjkxYTRiZWJiZjMwYzRkMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjM5YmZiYzQ0ZWM5YTRjNzNiOTFhNGJlYmJmMzBjNGQyXzQ1NjA_7025f94e-b79e-4e83-9d2a-29ac5a31d497">9,500</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock were converted into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i6e2f405f9805409ea71195b19ce4e719_D20221001-20221231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" sca