79-3de5-459b-bac8-16d5a7d3ca74">195</ix:nonFraction> employee stock options.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">On June 10, 2021, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i768e4498074942ea8b021c78cdbaa22e_D20210610-20210610" decimals="INF" name="inpx:CommonStockSharesExchanged" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjAvZnJhZzphMmE5YjM4YWVmOTM0OTA5ODRmODBhZDJiMDI0YzdkYy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmEyYTliMzhhZWY5MzQ5MDk4NGY4MGFkMmIwMjRjN2RjXzMyMDA_316c6a02-0081-4af5-a9eb-630f525915e9">6</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock in connection with the cashless exercise of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ie8b25ce9c80b42f8b3dc5fceec8589da_I20210610" decimals="INF" name="inpx:WarrantsExercisedForCommonShares" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjAvZnJhZzphMmE5YjM4YWVmOTM0OTA5ODRmODBhZDJiMDI0YzdkYy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmEyYTliMzhhZWY5MzQ5MDk4NGY4MGFkMmIwMjRjN2RjXzMyNzA_a7344f5e-9ead-4e7c-ac0d-f95b7debf577">82</ix:nonFraction> employee stock options.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">During the year ended December&#160;31, 2022 and 2021, the Company recorded a charge of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i923eb00f43404a668f5fd0519f7fafa6_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjAvZnJhZzphMmE5YjM4YWVmOTM0OTA5ODRmODBhZDJiMDI0YzdkYy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmEyYTliMzhhZWY5MzQ5MDk4NGY4MGFkMmIwMjRjN2R