spective grant dates.</ix:continuation> </span></div><div id="ibb5d0eb17e77468eb79dc6027d5535b1_223"></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 23 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="inpx:WarrantsTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzg5Njg_cd017fbf-c814-4ab5-ad3b-4b23833ffece" continuedAt="ifcf4f37fd67a4dd1a2ce1d232614e43e" escape="true">Warrants</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="ifcf4f37fd67a4dd1a2ce1d232614e43e" continuedAt="ib0f8d962df29454ab1c7c4cff306994a"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On January 24, 2021, Inpixon entered into a Securities Purchase Agreement with an institutional investor named therein (the &#8220;Investor&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company agreed to issue and sell, in a registered direct offering, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="if9f431ec8d364471b527e9ba32ac8ee4_D20210124-20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzI1MA_8c37aabd-1af4-4a44-bbca-782045a9553c">77,334</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, par value $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ic6054a9778c9434b9e03c46ce9a62658_I20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzMwMQ_5784d4a3-a04c-4d1a-8b54-d3a079893ef8">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share, and warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ia0fbe0250a3646fb82aa2591b157d2f2_D20210124-20210124" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockNumberOfWarrantsIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzM0Ng_e7dc542b-c05e-4810-8f04-d2912311fa45">258,065</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock (the &#8220;Purchase Warrants&#8221;) at a combined offering price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ib2e345007b984dba9c36a2cbeb3926a6_I20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzQzMA_a571a6a4-13df-4256-8057-20349e2e60b6">116.25</ix:nonFraction> per share. The Purchase Warrants have an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ib2e345007b984dba9c36a2cbeb3926a6_I20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzQ5Mg_fee8b9d1-9cd4-4297-bca6-877a9ab64177">116.25</ix:nonFraction> per share. Each Purchase Warrant is exercisable for one share of common stock and will be immediately exercisable and will expire <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ib2e345007b984dba9c36a2cbeb3926a6_I20210124" name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingTerm" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzYyNQ_1ad392bd-8238-41e3-8f8b-9e4d090e1b3f">five years</ix:nonNumeric> from the issuance date.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company also offered and sold to the Purchaser pre-funded warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i38e7cd81d5f84bb8ab92112fb620cc01_D20210124-20210124" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockNumberOfWarrantsIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzc0MQ_47986cd2-a77c-462d-97f7-29012a292c85">180,732</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock (the &#8220;Pre-Funded Warrants&#8221; and, together with the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="if9f431ec8d364471b527e9ba32ac8ee4_D20210124-20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzgxNw_8c37aabd-1af4-4a44-bbca-782045a9553c">77,334</ix:nonFraction> shares and the Purchase Warrants, the &#8220;Securities&#8221;), in lieu of shares of common stock at the Investor&#8217;s election. Each Pre-Funded Warrant is exercisable for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ia97351f3f1504050b75ef419f17145b8_I20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzk3OA_6dfcaa02-7fef-449f-ae44-d38694351886">one</ix:nonFraction> share of common stock. The purchase price of each Pre-Funded Warrant is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ia97351f3f1504050b75ef419f17145b8_I20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzEwNTM_2691f410-5cb3-4d04-92f5-2cf95606da21">116.18</ix:nonFraction>, and the exercise price of each Pre-Funded Warrant is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i524849106c5c43f9b5570f96e77b970b_I20210124" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzExMTA_4491b415-9277-4737-a800-cf1b66a118a1">0.08</ix:nonFraction> per share. The Pre-Funded Warrants are immediately exercisable and may be exercised at any time until all of the Pre-Funded Warrants are exercised in full.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During the year ended December 31, 2021, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i29c1ac29bc3c414fa36c7c0727994846_D20210101-20211231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzEzMjk_1abfcdb4-7614-4257-b521-f5ad5ac52653">180,732</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock in connection with the exercise of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i5f51c75d81844700bbc660510660a679_I20211231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:WarrantsExercisedForCommonShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzEzOTA_72a92f5b-5c45-474c-9b3f-2bd42b8808e3">180,732</ix:nonFraction> Pre-Funded Warrants at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i5f51c75d81844700bbc660510660a679_I20211231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzE0MTY_c07295ee-ce3c-4ef3-90ec-62a2f913613b">0.08</ix:nonFraction> per share in connection with the January 24, 2021 Securities Purchase Agreement.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-