deb8e1accd49_I20210913" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionOriginalIssuanceDiscount" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzQ5NDI_d443ff7e-fd89-437d-8854-0716ade3bd1f">8</ix:nonFraction>% of the Stated Value for an aggregate subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i40e90c6bee354d03be55a60f7a5c3152_I20210913" decimals="-5" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionAggregateValue" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzUwMDY_fcf87911-d05e-4461-b1da-8082f3967a3b">54.1</ix:nonFraction> million. </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">On January 28, 2022, the Company entered into an exchange agreement with the holder of certain existing warrants of the Company which were exercisable for an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="id4bfe0e393cd4a62917da742a8e59eb8_I20220128" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzUxOTE_2588ef46-b09b-46d7-8754-0a2e5badcef6">657,402</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. Pursuant to the exchange agreement, the Company agreed to issue to the warrant holder an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i494adca3f436478c9ce419425f818b77_D20220128-20220128" decimals="INF" name="inpx:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzUzMzQ_06980b4c-ebfe-4c07-bc64-584538c89054">184,153</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock and rights to receive an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i450d5fdd354a4904a933b1e22e0b92dd_I20220128" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzUzOTg_ad7df1e3-9792-4e63-a710-252d3b2ed354">52,513</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock in exchange for the existing warrants.  The Company accounted for the exchange agreement as a warrant modification.  The Company determined the fair value of the existing warrants as if issued on the exchange agreement date and compared that to the fair value of the common stock issued.  The Company calculated the fair value of the existing warrants using a Black-Scholes Option pricing model and determined it to be approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="id4bfe0e393cd4a62917da742a8e59eb8_I20220128" decimals="2" name="inpx:ClassOrRightOfWarrantFairValueAssumptionsFairValueOfExistingWarrantsPerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzU4NTc_adc4561d-a0e1-42b2-8276-1e4354930dfa">12.00</ix:nonFraction> per share.  The fair value of the common stock issued was based on the closing stock price of the date of the exchange.  The total fair value of the warrants prior to modification was greater than the fair value of the common stock issued, and therefore, there was no incremental fair value related to the exchange.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Between March 15 and March 22, 2022, we received cash redemption notices from the holders of the Company's Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock issued on September 15, 2021, totaling <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ib911675815594b97a467ca57afa54273_D20220315-20220322" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzYzNTk_03f84cdf-1419-481f-8022-2cd73d3ba9a3">49,250</ix:nonFraction> shares of Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock for aggregate cash required to be paid of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib911675815594b97a467ca57afa54273_D20220315-20220322" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:StockRedeemedOrCalledDuringPeriodValue" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzY0NjU_336ada91-5be6-4493-8a44-29e7cc78a01f">49.3</ix:nonFraction> million. In addition, upon redemption of the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock, each holder forfeited <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i34837b40b15744dd96fe25059d144076_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:EquityInstrumentsSharesForfeitedUponRedemptionPercent" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzY1NjU_bfef6564-56f6-4dae-899e-be34a0d2a164">75</ix:nonFraction>% of the related warrants that were issued together with the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock (the "Series 7 Warrants"). <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i5cf5011017064678add995938375569d_D20220315-20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:ClassOrRightOfWarrantForfeitures" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzY2OTE_2a933968-128b-40fa-a6d8-57dc771c35aa">394,000</ix:nonFraction> corresponding warrants issued in connection with the issuance of the Series 7 Convertible Preferred Stock been forfeited and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ib2fee1e5f827446badbda95ddb18ff47_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzY4MTk_59da5e8c-d7d6-4cf0-a780-8bb5da269b38">232,675</ix:nonFraction> related warrants remain outstanding. </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On March 22, 2022, the Company entered into a securities purchase agreement with certain investors pursuant to which the Company agreed to issue and sell, in a registered direct offering sold an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i332a144c32f945d78599c6a199b0c221_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzcwNjk_7fb64ff3-e824-48d1-aa29-c336a4e10a3f">53,197.7234</ix:nonFraction> shares of the Company&#8217;s Series 8 Convertible Preferred Shares, par value $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i332a144c32f945d78599c6a199b0c221_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzcxNDU_78de608f-46e9-4d89-b9c1-92e580d01592">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share, and warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i14d2086e1c2541d8b5ac821fb5f18cbe_D20220322-20220322" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzcxOTA_124cdd63-d2e0-4193-92ca-2185a49f07c8">1,503,726</ix:nonFraction> shares of common </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-61</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><ix:continuation id="icbd6365c6a7049f8a3fb5e24949c04d4"><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">stock. Each share and related warrants were sold together at a subscription amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i332a144c32f945d78599c6a199b0c221_I20220322" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockSubscriptionPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzcyOTY_60583b90-8aeb-4641-aaf7-3c4a8