400;line-height:120%">The Company also offered and sold to the Purchaser pre-funded warrants to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i816e2b26f9f54e16bbf3c3f00df2bf78_D20221018-20221018" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SaleOfStockNumberOfWarrantsIssuedInTransaction" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzgyMzQ_10d9cdb0-2215-49af-8083-edeabbd38af0">2,310,990</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, in lieu of shares of common stock at the Purchaser&#8217;s election. Each pre-funded warrant is exercisable for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i607cbe54d0e14b5a99395f11feb8328b_I20221018" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzgzNjc_3cc1106f-e0d8-4c92-83b6-a85c68fffc00">one</ix:nonFraction> share of common stock. The purchase price of each pre-funded warrant was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="ia3a3f8942af54772921b16d30e4aab27_I20221018" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzg0NDM_3d9f86f7-6b77-46c4-bf5c-db2d565c7d02">5.849</ix:nonFraction>, and the exercise price of each pre-funded warrant is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i64e86c31d2a6485f9ae364415a78486e_I20221018" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzg1MDA_41e04af8-71b2-4572-b3a6-c34d2889d4e5">0.001</ix:nonFraction> per share. The pre-funded warrants are immediately exercisable and may be exercised at any time until all of the pre-funded warrants are exercised in full.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">During the three months ended December 31, 2022, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="ia436406988fa448091445113da095fc8_D20221001-20221231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzg3Mjc_771ea0fd-9441-4537-b4da-b15670cdd092">930,990</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock in connection with the exercise of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i776969434b7d42829d5cb6c07dbd656f_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:WarrantsExercisedForCommonShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yMjMvZnJhZzo3MjM3NjkyMDhlYjg0ODY5ODUzNTRhMDg2Nzg0MDIwMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjcyMzc2OTIwOGViODQ4Njk4NTM1NGEwODY3ODQwMjAzXzg3ODg_c805bf7b-3c41-4dea-a6fc-b4f3818bf12d">930,990</ix:nonFraction> pre-funded warrants from the October 2022 capital raise at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i776969434b7d42829d5cb6c07dbd656f_I202212