000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i5e24f7174a884794a2d2aee1ed67e060_I20211231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" format="ixt:fixed-zero" scale="3" id="_c3cf1ccb-dd8d-40d8-986b-d49797d93c2e">&#8212;</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ic6e0c736c2d848ae85df649521b1a84d_I20211231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" format="ixt:fixed-zero" scale="3" id="_a738f2db-2fdd-4a9e-a406-1ec3b1e565c8">&#8212;</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ic1bc9cf9dabb422eb1a4bdfce85db9c9_I20211231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_1239aa84-1301-4364-9dde-166bea1bd241">7,673</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ia08793a59bad4c3faf28f641c7db56ff_I20211231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_e798b682-000b-40d1-a4a3-0194f3973cec">5,546</ix:nonFraction>)</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i79a233d197d94c82a3505a235880a8b3_I20211231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:Goodwill" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="_165693d4-6fd2-4562-9d32-4f1899c156da">2,127</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-70</span></div></div></div><div id="ibb5d0eb17e77468eb79dc6027d5535b1_244"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 28 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzEwNzA3_67727e50-ac2b-4f5c-a3f3-3e21db015a1b" continuedAt="iaddb988461544b23a2bc7ba904af6ac3" escape="true">Related Party Transactions</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="iaddb988461544b23a2bc7ba904af6ac3" continuedAt="i2d9ee52075014c8d89595873ea59feb9"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Sysorex Note Purchase Agreement</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Nadir Ali, the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer and a member of its Board of Directors, was previously a member of the Board of Directors of Sysorex until he resigned on May 14, 2021. In addition, Nadir Ali entered into a consulting agreement with Sysorex, pursuant to which he agreed to provide certain business services specified in the agreement for the benefit of Sysorex in exchange for shares of Sysorex's common stock.  The consulting agreement was terminated on October 14, 2021.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On December 31, 2018, the Company and Sysorex entered into a note purchase agreement (the &#8220;Note Purchase Agreement&#8221;) pursuant to which the Company agreed to purchase from Sysorex at a purchase price equal to the Loan Amount (as defined below), a secured promissory note (the &#8220;Secured Note&#8221;) for up to an aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="iba77ec42e38348589bcd0254445338e5_I20181231" decimals="-6" name="inpx:AggregateMaximumPrincipalAmountOfNoteReceivable" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzg5Nw_164812ab-7be5-48c8-bbb6-9860e9657074">3</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Principal Amount&#8221;), including any amounts advanced through the date of the Secured Note (the &#8220;Prior Advances&#8221;), to be borrowed and disbursed in increments (such borrowed amount, together with the Prior Advances, collectively referred to as the &#8220;Loan Amount&#8221;), with interest to accrue at a rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i5ca1a0f63ed94ce4bd7656786536fb69_I20181231" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzEyMDM_69f472bb-9719-4379-8526-671109f1138a">10</ix:nonFraction>% percent per annum on all such Loan Amounts, beginning as of the date of disbursement with respect to any portion of such Loan Amount. In addition, Sysorex agreed to pay $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i1d828120a2904c7495965f3bc6815d07_D20180101-20181231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:LegalFeesAccountingCostsDueDiligenceMonitoringAndOtherTransactionCosts" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzEzNzU_d7f661e7-ff15-4105-a96b-09eae2b95aaf">20,000</ix:nonFraction> to the Company to cover the Company&#8217;s legal fees, accounting costs, due diligence, monitoring and other transaction costs incurred in connection with the purchase and sale of the Secured Note (the &#8220;Transaction Expense Amount&#8221;), all of which amount is included in the Principal Amount. Sysorex may borrow repay and borrow under the Secured Note, as needed, for a total outstanding balance, exclusive of any unpaid accrued interest, not to exceed the Principal Amount at any one time.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">All sums advanced by the Company to the Maturity Date (as defined below) pursuant to the terms of the Note Purchase Agreement will become part of the aggregate Loan Amount underlying the Secured Note. All outstanding principal amounts and accrued unpaid interest owing under the Secured Note shall become immediately due and payable on the earlier to occur of (i) <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i9dbca854ef57413f974d40d40cf02fb9_D20190203-20190203" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzEwNzA2_7c110f7a-8884-4786-a639-53a444e471bd">24</ix:nonNumeric> month anniversary of the date the Secured Note is issued (the &#8220;Maturity Date&#8221;), (ii) at such date when declared due and payable by the Company upon the occurrence of an Event of Default (as defined in the Secured Note), or (iii) at any such earlier date as set forth in the Secured Note. All accrued unpaid interest shall be payable in cash. On February 4, 2019, April 2, 2019, and May 22, 2019, the Secured Note was amended to increase the Principal Amount from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ibc6a41dd3ec54f6ab8c1b4bdb4d7b67d_I20190203" decimals="-6" name="inpx:AggregatePrincipalAmountOfNoteReceivable" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzI2OTE_e1a4c982-b4f7-40e3-88ff-c64cc76bf075">3</ix:nonFraction> million to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i40abaad88cf64dcd88b1ffff0c7bd939_I20190204" decimals="-6" name="inpx:AggregatePrincipalAmountOfNoteReceivable" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzI3MDU_a6bda180-b031-437d-a7bd-f0ba8dd09887">5</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i0689349f6fa146539ca919e22a79e65a_I20190401" decimals="-6" name="inpx:AggregatePrincipalAmountOfNo