" contextRef="i734e2ecd11514201b4919beed5af299b_I20200228" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzI5NzA_967ddb1f-9a3b-4847-8c1f-233a91317692">18</ix:nonFraction>% to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="ia47eef03394f489ca01822070a6487ae_I20200301" decimals="2" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzI5NzY_3bbf72cf-f3f1-4cb9-832c-9b0d18622697">21</ix:nonFraction>% or the maximum rate allowable by law and to require a cash payment to the Company by Sysorex against the Loan Amount in an amount equal to no less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i2b4f14db2d824363bd717950f07fb05a_I20200301" decimals="2" name="inpx:DebtInstrumentRequiredCashPaymentOfAggregateCashProceeds" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzMxMzE_b6cf5c6d-a1b4-4885-b0af-2b7b4b22fc13">6</ix:nonFraction>% of the aggregate gross proceeds raised following the completion of any financing, or series of related financings, in which Sysorex raises aggregate gross proceeds of at least $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i5bb7bf54857e4577ace36b0cbabcfb89_I20200301" decimals="-5" name="inpx:AggregateMaximumPrincipalAmountOfNoteReceivable" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzMzMTA_54fb323f-9d47-4660-a68e-f2ad19c87068">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million. </span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In accordance with the terms of the Systat License Agreement on June 30, 2020, the Company partitioned a portion of the outstanding balance of the Secured Note into a new note in an amount equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib9f5746009e845e882f010ab1a323697_I20200630" decimals="-6" name="inpx:AmountOfNoteAssignedUnderLicenseAgreement" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzM1MTM_6a2019db-ebb9-4744-9e54-09277e861af4">3</ix:nonFraction> million in principal plus accrued interest (the &#8220;Closing Note&#8221;) and assigned the Closing Note and all rights and obligations thereunder to Systat in accordance with the terms and conditions of that certain Promissory Note Assignment and Assumption Agreement ("Assignment Agreement"). An additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ic2609bda924349cfbcf6ae369f1a3114_I20201231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:AmountOfNoteAssignedUnderLicenseAgreement" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzM4MDY_1727b947-4867-4fe0-b5b7-3e02d93c62a7">2.3</ix:nonFraction> million of the principal balance underlying the Sysorex Note was partitioned into a new note and assigned to Systat as consideration payable for the rights granted under the license as of December 31, 2020. During the year ended December 31, 2020, an additional amount of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="icd07560856714319a26d27e2f1b71f1a_D20200101-20201231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzQwODc_1d5b1911-900a-4e56-b10e-63929e96061c">2.6</ix:nonFraction> million was advanced under the Secured Note and approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="icd07560856714319a26d27e2f1b71f1a_D20200101-20201231" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzQxNDQ_4843e0b5-e36f-4362-9fa4-65db81f2e04d">200,000</ix:nonFraction> was repaid.  The amount owed for principal as of December 31, 2020 and accrued interest through September 30, 2019 by Sysorex to the Company as of December 31, 2020 was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ic2609bda924349cfbcf6ae369f1a3114_I20201231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableAccruedInterestBeforeAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzQzMzA_9d99d537-332f-4e43-aa1e-565a5aecd75e">7.7</ix:nonFraction> million. These amounts exclude $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i84946824f035436da05fd32ac7868088_D20191001-20191231" d