the Secured Note was assigned to Systat on March 19, 2021, as the final portion of the total consideration due in connection with the license.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During the three months ended March 31, 2020 an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i265749e7248741b6a3f66192b2284044_D20200101-20200331" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLongTermLinesOfCredit" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzQ5MzI_af5719b4-c936-4838-ba34-7cc7d3fe3ea2">117,000</ix:nonFraction> was advanced under the Secured Note and the Company was entitled to an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i265749e7248741b6a3f66192b2284044_D20200101-20200331" decimals="0" name="inpx:FinancingReceivableInterestIncomeBeforeAllowanceForCreditLossUnlikelyToBeReceived" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzUwMTc_9d995d15-0500-422d-a261-53e5c4ffb235">251,806</ix:nonFraction> of interest in accordance with the terms of the Note, but did not accrue due to the uncertainty of repayment.  An additional $1&#160;million of the principal balance under the Secured Note was assigned to Systat on March 19, 2021, as the final portion of the total consideration due in connection with the license.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-71</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><ix:continuation id="i2d9ee52075014c8d89595873ea59feb9" continuedAt="i78d5330fe159405c92c254ca8780efd5"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">As of April 14, 2021, the Sysorex Note Purchase Agreement was settled, see Sysorex Securities Settlement Agreement below.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Sysorex Receivable</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On February 20, 2019, the Company, Sysorex and Atlas Technology Group, LLC (&#8220;Atlas&#8221;) entered into a settlement agreement resulting in a net award of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i773ec5c21dc2482ea73fc84b90d5d649_D20190220-20190220" decimals="0" name="inpx:SettlementAgreementOfNetAward" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzU2MjA_6b6dd769-b86f-4bd0-9f77-9a5beed49d55">941,796</ix:nonFraction> whereby Atlas agreed to accept an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i773ec5c21dc2482ea73fc84b90d5d649_D20190220-20190220" decimals="INF" name="inpx:CommonSharesIssuedForSettlementOfAmountOwed" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzU2NzA_f2d29769-1550-41d8-94b1-d1ccdada76dd">16,655</ix:nonFraction> shares of freely-tradable common stock of the Company in full satisfaction of the award.&#160;The Company and Sysorex each agreed pursuant to the terms and conditions of that certain Separation and Distribution Agreement, dated August 7, 2018, as amended, that <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i709c789da37f4879b28c6c0fe464c1b5_I20180807" decimals="INF" name="inpx:ArbitrationIndemnificationPercentage" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzU5Mjk_e35611fc-31df-4d20-b22d-ae8c183f3f73">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the costs and liabilities related to the arbitration action would be shared by each party following the Sysorex Spin-off. As a result, Sysorex owes the Company $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib3ec1d46959d42abae5ce2ec1398257c_D20210101-20211231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:SettlementAmountReceivableFromRelatedParty" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzYwOTY_e45460c8-1460-457b-b0dd-b47c383bb86f">0.6</ix:nonFraction> million for the settlement plus the interest accrued during the fiscal year ended December 31, 2020 of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="icd07560856714319a26d27e2f1b71f1a_D20200101-20201231" decimals="-5" name="inpx:InterestAccrued" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzYyMDM_66c5e90e-9b93-4ce6-8fcc-6760afc54471">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million. The total owed to the Company for this settlement as of December 31, 2022 and 2021 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="iec0bc1f01aa84ea297dd1797b20bfcb6_D20220101-20221231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SettlementAndInterestAccrued" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzYzMDM_091e274e-d27c-4f88-8cf3-451791aa6362"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="ib3ec1d46959d42abae5ce2ec1398257c_D20210101-20211231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:SettlementAndInterestAccrued" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzYzMDM_b5473a18-a823-49fa-87d7-db1943894537">0</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>.  The Company established a full valuation allowance against this balance as of December 31, 2020.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">As of April 14, 2021, the Sysorex Receivable was settled, see Sysorex Securities Settlement Agreement below.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Sysorex Securities Settlement Agreement</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On April 14, 2021, the Company entered into a Securities Settlement Agreement (the &#8220;SSA&#8221;) and a Rights Letter Agreement (the &#8220;RLA&#8221;), each with Sysorex, whereby Sysorex agreed to satisfy in full its outstanding debt, in the aggregate amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i3f9f35729ea24ee280b1336c48311ecd_I20210331" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:NotesReceivableGross" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzY3OTc_3d5661c5-90f7-417b-a482-d2f3a74da0ad">9.1</ix:nonFraction> million as of March 31, 2021, owed to the Company under that certain secured promissory note, originally dated December 31, 2018, as amended from time to time, and in connection with that certain settlement agreement, dated February 20, 2019, by and among the Company, Sysorex and Atlas Technology Group, LLC (the &#8220;Debt Settlement&#8221;). To effect the Debt Settlement, Sysorex agreed to issue to the Company (i) pursuant to the terms of the SSA, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="id32afc0231214fd6848a003be2fc0b62_D20210414-20210414" decimals="INF" name="inpx:StockReceivedDuringPeriodForDebtSettlementShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzcyMzQ_5d174ff0-30be-40b9-836c-d7ac18491bab">12,972,189</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usdPerShare" contextRef="i272e6cd21a394862a89f9b124a83311f_I20210414" decimals="INF" name="inpx:StockReceivedForDebtSettlementCommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzcyNjU_fa65c44f-6a35-49c8-9850-f065fef3b9f4">0.00001</ix:nonFraction> par value per share, and (ii) rights to acquire <ix:nonFraction unitRef="shares" contextRef="i893e11bd9a3348658eafeb20977475d8_D20210414-20210414" decimals="INF" name="inpx:StockReceivedDuringPeriodForDebtSettlementShares" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzczMTY_52983421-86a5-494c-9850-61e1f3b76de3">3,000,000</ix:nonFraction> additional shares of its common stock pursuant to the terms of the RLA. The Debt Settlement was entered into in connection with Sysorex&#8217;s closing of a reverse triangular merger with TTM Digital Assets &amp; Technologies, Inc.  </span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">The Company recorded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="id32afc0231214fd6848a003be2fc0b62_D20210414-20210414" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableAllowanceForCreditLossesRecovery" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzc1NjU_36bc54e6-702e-4230-b9ec-ae68f978a295">7.5</ix:nonFraction> million for the release of the previously recorded valuation allowance, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="id32afc0231214fd6848a003be2fc0b62_D20210414-20210414" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:InterestIncomeInterestEarningAsset" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzc2MzI_15ae896e-c09a-4955-977c-76e92ea72ed6">1.6</ix:nonFraction> million of interest income, and</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"> </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">a gain on settlement of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="id32afc0231214fd6848a003be2fc0b62_D20210414-20210414" decimals="-5" name="inpx:GainLossOnFinancingReceivableSettlement" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="6" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzc2ODM_2b641260-7bca-44e0-ba4d-dacc8cc173e6">49.8</ix:nonFraction> million equal to the difference in the carry value of the promissory note, including interest and value of the common stock and rights to acquire additional shares received in the settlement.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In connection with the Debt Settlement, the Company also entered into a Registration Rights Agreement, dated as of April 14, 2021 (the &#8220;RRA&#8221;), with Sysorex and certain other shareholders of Sysorex (the &#8220;Holders&#8221;). Pursuant to the terms of the RRA, Sysorex must, subject to certain limitations, register the resale of the shares of common stock held by the Company and the Holders, with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the &#8220;SEC&#8221;), during the period that begins on the 90th day following April 14, 2021. In the event Sysorex fails to register such shares within that timeframe, or otherwise fails to meet its obligations under the RRA, then, subject to certain limitations, the Company and the Holders may be entitled to receive from Sysorex an amount in cash equal to the product of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="number" contextRef="i343c52929e5944ecab171654006193d1_D20210414-20211231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:ContingentAgreementEntitlementOfCashFactor" scale="-2" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzg2NjY_e218bb19-79c3-450b-8882-89578117c3c4">1.5</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the value of their shares (as set forth in the RRA), which amount is payable each month following the date of such failure for so long as the failure continues; provided that the shares are considered "Registrable Securities" as defined by the RRA.  The shares of Sysorex common stock were not deemed Registrable Securities as defined by the RRA as of the date of the registration obligation. </span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Also, under the RRA, if Sysorex determines to prepare and file with the SEC a registration statement relating to an offering of any of its equity securities, for its own account or the account of others, then the Company and the Holders will have the right, subject to certain limitations, to require Sysorex to include in such registration statement all or any part of the shares of common stock held by them.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Cardinal Health Ventures Investment</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Nadir Ali, our Chief Executive Officer and director, is also a member in CVH through 3AM, which may, in certain circumstances, be entitled to manage the affairs of CVH. Mr. Ali&#8217;s relationship may create conflicts of interest between Mr. Ali&#8217;s obligations to our company and its shareholders and his economic interests and possible fiduciary obligations in CVH through 3AM. For example, Mr. Ali may be in a position to influence or manage the affairs of CVH in a manner that may be viewed as contrary to the best interests of either the Company or CVH and their respective stakeholders.  (See Note 14).</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-72</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"><ix:continuation id="i78d5330fe159405c92c254ca8780efd5" continuedAt="ibe4ed4458a9d4c2cbd7fb36d84aeecb5">Director Services Agreement</ix:continuation></span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"><ix:continuation id="ibe4ed4458a9d4c2cbd7fb36d84aeecb5">The Company and Kareem Irfan, a director of the Company, have amended Mr. Irfan's Director Services Agreement on May 16, 2022 (as amended, the "Amended Director Services Agreement") to increase his quarterly compensation by an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i53eacbc229e544b29c136833abb48d97_D20220101-20221231" decimals="-3" name="inpx:RelatedPartyTransactionExpensesFromTransactionsWithRelatedPartyAdditionalCompensationPerMonth" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDQvZnJhZzpmZGM0NzFhMmQ1MDk0MzJlYTFlMTJkZWNiZGEyOWFmMi90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOmZkYzQ3MWEyZDUwOTQzMmVhMWUxMmRlY2JkYTI5YWYyXzEwMzky_122f4bd0-297a-47c3-a5ee-56aa7fd2b458">10,000</ix:nonFraction> per month as consideration for the additional time and efforts dedicated to the Company and management in support of the evaluation of strategic relationships and growth initiatives. The Amended Director Services Agreement supersedes and replaces all prior agreements by and between the Company and Mr. Irfan.</ix:continuation> </span></div><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">F-73</span></div></div></div><div id="ibb5d0eb17e77468eb79dc6027d5535b1_247"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:90pt;width:100%"><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Table of Contents</span></div><div style="margin-top:3pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">INPIXON AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</span></div></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Note 29 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDcvZnJhZzo0MzVmYzFlNTViMmQ0OGZlOGJlOWNjYmIxM2JkM2QxMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjQzNWZjMWU1NWIyZDQ4ZmU4YmU5Y2NiYjEzYmQzZDEzXzI1NDQ_738035b7-8fd5-434e-ad6b-c16037622557" continuedAt="i5d141c83e6904570874d91c29e7f80df" escape="true">Leases</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="i5d141c83e6904570874d91c29e7f80df" continuedAt="i766332a13d804c5fae464b96c3c5ceb4"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company has operating leases for administrative offices in the United States (California), Canada, India, United Kingdom and Germany.</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company terminated the lease in Ratingen, Germany in January 2021. The Company entered into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="lease" contextRef="i30284d47d6b44ba08aec93f3562d8c6a_I20221231" decimals="INF" name="inpx:LesseeOperatingLeaseNumberOfLeasesEnteredInto" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDcvZnJhZzo0MzVmYzFlNTViMmQ0OGZlOGJlOWNjYmIxM2JkM2QxMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjQzNWZjMWU1NWIyZDQ4ZmU4YmU5Y2NiYjEzYmQzZDEzXzI1Nw_2a9fc03f-8b9a-4d06-9de0-6cae9d9ff505">two</ix:nonFraction> new operating leases for its administrative offices in Ratingen, Germany, both from February 1, 2021 through January 1, 2023. The monthly lease rate is approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i36412f66121c49808d732778bb2127e1_I20221231" decimals="0" name="inpx:LessorOperatingLeaseLeaseNotYetCommencedUndiscountedAmountPerMonth" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDcvZnJhZzo0MzVmYzFlNTViMmQ0OGZlOGJlOWNjYmIxM2JkM2QxMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjQzNWZjMWU1NWIyZDQ4ZmU4YmU5Y2NiYjEzYmQzZDEzXzQyNg_a0a8a577-d2c2-48b6-b5f7-421761c8a0c1">2,774</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i24f09ed999494eafb22de396f9f3a763_I20221231" decimals="0" name="inpx:LessorOperatingLeaseLeaseNotYetCommencedUndiscountedAmountPerMonth" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDcvZnJhZzo0MzVmYzFlNTViMmQ0OGZlOGJlOWNjYmIxM2JkM2QxMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjQzNWZjMWU1NWIyZDQ4ZmU4YmU5Y2NiYjEzYmQzZDEzXzQzMw_33894802-efb5-4cb5-b310-665c9557d6ab">1,083</ix:nonFraction> per month. The Company renewed the operating lease, which expires on July 31, 2023. The new monthly lease rate is approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i36412f66121c49808d732778bb2127e1_I20221231" decimals="0" name="inpx:LessorOperatingLeaseLeaseNotYetCommencedUndiscountedAmountNewPerMonth" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDcvZnJhZzo0MzVmYzFlNTViMmQ0OGZlOGJlOWNjYmIxM2JkM2QxMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjQzNWZjMWU1NWIyZDQ4ZmU4YmU5Y2NiYjEzYmQzZDEzXzU2NA_24c0f5d4-6570-474b-b7be-1c6658baca05">2,028</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i24f09ed999494eafb22de396f9f3a763_I20221231" decimals="0" name="inpx:LessorOperatingLeaseLeaseNotYetCommencedUndiscountedAmountNewPerMonth" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDcvZnJhZzo0MzVmYzFlNTViMmQ0OGZlOGJlOWNjYmIxM2JkM2QxMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjQzNWZjMWU1NWIyZDQ4ZmU4YmU5Y2NiYjEzYmQzZDEzXzU3MQ_912e85bd-75d9-47fc-82d9-e241b2d79cfc">1,633</ix:nonFraction>.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">As part of the acquisition of IntraNav on December 9, 2021. the Company acquired right-of-use assets and lease liabilities related to an operating lease for an office space (the IntraNav office) located in Frankfurt, Germany. This lease expires on January 6, 2025 and the current lease rate is approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="i312a13bbf7b1437e8236984c98b6873f_I20221231" decimals="0" name="inpx:LessorOperatingLeaseLeaseNotYetCommencedUndiscountedAmountPerMonth" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="0" id="id3VybDovL2RvY3MudjEvZG9jOmJiNWQwZWIxN2U3NzQ2OGViNzlkYzYwMjdkNTUzNWIxL3NlYzpiYjVkMGViMTdlNzc0NjhlYjc5ZGM2MDI3ZDU1MzViMV8yNDcvZnJhZzo0MzVmYzFlNTViMmQ0OGZlOGJlOWNjYmIxM2JkM2QxMy90ZXh0cmVnaW9uOjQzNWZjMWU1NWIyZDQ4ZmU4YmU5Y2NiYjEzYmQzZDEzXzg4NA_5c45a58a-b7a7-4359-b6d2-318042a792e5">9,232</ix:nonFraction> per month. </span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">The Company entered into two new operating leases for its administrative office in Hyderabad, India and Manila, Philippines. The Hyderabad, India and Manila, Philippines office lease expires on March 25, 2025 and May 14, 2025, respectively.The Company has no other operating or financing leases with terms greater than 12 months.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="ia78dd2c195fb43428268c4e05a3dad19_D20220101-20221231" name="inpx:ScheduleOfRightOfUseAssetsTabl